WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:04.367
We're about to play a brand-new
game called "Press &amp; Guess."

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.567
Here we go.

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:07.868
-♪ Press, Press,
Press and Guess, yeah ♪

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:10.033
-Now I'm going to need someone
to play against.

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:13.400
She is the executive producer
of the HBO Max docuseries

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.434
"The Way Down: God, Greed,
and the Cult of Gwen Shamblin."

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:20.501
Give it up for Chrissy Teigen!

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:22.734
-♪ Press, Press,
Press and Guess ♪

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:25.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.767
-Welcome!

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:29.167
-A new game?
-Alright. A new game.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:32.067
-A new game.
-Alright. Here's how it works.

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:33.434
We're going to take turns

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:36.534
pressing our faces up
against this window here...

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:38.834
and saying a random phrase.

00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:40.167
We have to get the other person

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:43.167
to guess the phrase
in 15 seconds.

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:45.467
If you have a window at home
where you can do this,

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:48.767
someone go outside, someone
stays in the living room.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.801
We can make it work. 15 seconds.

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.534
Phrases are on the cards
right here.

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:54.467
Since you're my guest,
you are going to go first.

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.167
-Oh, great.
-Whenever -- Yeah, of course.

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:58.400
-This is the first and last time
you're going to do this.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.767
-When you're ready,
take a look at your card

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:02.801
and then press your face
into the window

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:05.567
and try to get me
to guess the phrase.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.634 --> 00:01:09.567
-Okay. I'm going first?
-Yes. I'm not looking.

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:11.334
-Questlove has a good view
over there.

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:13.200
Okay.
-Are you ready?

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.801
-I mean, we didn't -- Okay.
We're just going to go for it?

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:18.634
-Yeah. Go for it.
-Like, pretty hard?

00:01:18.634 --> 00:01:19.901
-Go for it.

00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:22.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:25.200
-Wait. I forgot it. Okay.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.634
[ Cymbal crash ]

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:27.934
Okay.

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:29.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.801 --> 00:01:36.834
Spill -- Oh, no,
I couldn't say it, though.

00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:38.934
My teeth go out too far.

00:01:38.934 --> 00:01:40.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.868
Why can't I --

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:44.133
-No, the other way was better.

00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:45.834
-This way?
-Yeah.

00:01:45.834 --> 00:01:48.100
[ Muffled ]

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.801
-"Change your teeth."

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:51.300
-[ Muffled ]

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.634
"Feel good teeth."

00:01:52.634 --> 00:01:54.033
-[ Muffled ]
-"Feel."

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:55.601
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:57.200
-No! [ Laughs ]

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.801
-Feel the -- Feel the something?

00:01:59.801 --> 00:02:02.100
Fill?

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.501
Spill the tea?
-Spill the tea.

00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:05.234
-Spill the tea!
I would have gotten it!

00:02:05.234 --> 00:02:07.033
[ Sad tuba ]
Darn.

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:09.234
Alright.
15 seconds is not quite enough.

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:10.834
Alright. Here we go.
Now it's my turn.

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:13.234
Oh, my gosh. You're going to
try to listen to it.

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:15.167
-It's hard! It's --
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:17.234
-Teeth go out, so it's like --

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:18.701
-This is hard without

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:20.567
even pressing my face
against the glass.

00:02:20.567 --> 00:02:22.400
-Have you tried this? Because
it's not -- it's not easy.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.734
-Alright. Ready?

00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:26.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:32.767
[ Muffled ]

00:02:32.767 --> 00:02:34.200
-What?!

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.434
-[ Muffled ]

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:40.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.801
[ Muffled ]

00:02:42.801 --> 00:02:44.667
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:47.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:51.434
-What? What?!

00:02:51.434 --> 00:02:53.834
[ Applause ]

00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:57.767
-[ Muffled ]

00:02:57.767 --> 00:03:00.601
I can't even do the first word.

00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:02.133
[ Muffled ]

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:03.200
-Kids?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.868
-[ Muffled ]
-Kids.

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:06.634
[ Muffled ]

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:07.801
-Si...

00:03:07.801 --> 00:03:09.667
-[ Muffled ]
-Lids.

00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:11.701
-[ Muffled ]
-Shins.

00:03:11.701 --> 00:03:16.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:18.868
-It was --
-No.

00:03:18.868 --> 00:03:22.734
Pigs in a blanket! Wow!

00:03:22.734 --> 00:03:25.534
-Alright. You are up.
You are up right now.

00:03:25.534 --> 00:03:27.567
You can use this part.
-Okay.

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:31.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.734 --> 00:03:34.267
Okay.

00:03:34.267 --> 00:03:35.667
-Alright, bud.

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:39.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.067 --> 00:03:42.400
-[ Muffled ]

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.567
-A key?

00:03:43.567 --> 00:03:44.834
-Hakuna!

00:03:44.834 --> 00:03:45.934
-Matata!

00:03:45.934 --> 00:03:47.367
-Yeah!

00:03:47.367 --> 00:03:49.200
♪♪

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.467
-Yes! We got one.
That's all we needed.

00:03:56.667 --> 00:04:00.234
Okay. Okay.

00:04:00.234 --> 00:04:02.100
Pay attention.
We got this. We got this.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:03.634
-Okay.

00:04:03.634 --> 00:04:08.200
♪♪

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.000
-[ Muffled ]

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.501
-Up, up, and away!

00:04:12.501 --> 00:04:14.367
-Yes! Wow. Okay.

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:16.100
We are getting the hang of this.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.767
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.767 --> 00:04:20.067
[ Rasta horn blares ]

00:04:20.067 --> 00:04:21.501
Okay.
You know what that sound means?

00:04:21.501 --> 00:04:23.400
It's time for the bonus round.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.334
To raise the stakes,
we both will be saying

00:04:25.334 --> 00:04:27.601
the same phrase into the window,

00:04:27.601 --> 00:04:29.868
trying to get Questlove
to guess what we are saying.

00:04:29.868 --> 00:04:31.634
-Oh, boy. Alright.

00:04:31.634 --> 00:04:33.234
-Let's take a look
at the final phrase.

00:04:33.234 --> 00:04:36.767
Here we go.
-Okay.

00:04:36.767 --> 00:04:38.467
Okay.

00:04:38.467 --> 00:04:40.133
-Oh, gosh.

00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:42.234
-Alright. Where do you want?
You can go there. I'll go here.

00:04:42.234 --> 00:04:45.367
-Alright.

00:04:45.367 --> 00:04:46.601
-Wait. I forgot.

00:04:46.601 --> 00:04:48.100
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.167
Okay. No. I got it. Okay.
-Yeah.

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:52.868
♪♪

00:04:52.868 --> 00:04:58.167
[ Both muffled ]

00:04:58.167 --> 00:05:02.934
[ Chrissy muffled ]

00:05:02.934 --> 00:05:06.968
[ Jimmy muffled ]

00:05:06.968 --> 00:05:10.601
[ Chrissy muffled ]

00:05:10.601 --> 00:05:14.033
[ Jimmy muffled ]

00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:19.300
-I spy a...

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:22.767
[ Both muffled ]

00:05:22.767 --> 00:05:25.367
-I spy...

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:27.200
[ Chrissy muffled ]

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.767
[ Buzzer ]

00:05:28.767 --> 00:05:34.200
-I -- I spy
with my little eye!

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.767
-The hell?

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:38.000
♪♪

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.000
[ Applause ]

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.667
-That was "Press &amp; Guess."

00:05:43.667 --> 00:05:45.801
The champion, Chrissy Teigen,
everybody.

